{"seq":1,"slug":"market-risk-hedging","title":"市场风险与对冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-risk-management/market-credit-risk/market-risk-hedging","wordCount":1524,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"市场风险与对冲\">市场风险与对冲</h1><p>一个期权交易台早上开盘时账面是平的，到中午标的资产涨了 2%，账面却出现了非线性的盈亏——这不是估值出错，而是市场风险的真面目：组合价值对各个风险因子的敏感度本身在随市场移动。这篇要讲的，是怎样把这种敏感度拆解成可管理的部件（希腊字母），再用衍生品把不想要的暴露对冲掉。它把<a href=\"../foundations/var-expected-shortfall\">VaR 与预期损失</a>的度量落到真实交易组合上，也是<a href=\"../regulation-stress-testing/basel-capital-regulation\">巴塞尔协议与资本监管</a>里 FRTB 交易账簿资本规则的业务前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-风险因子与敏感度\">核心概念：风险因子与敏感度</h2><p>市场风险的来源是有限几类风险因子：利率、汇率、股价、商品价格，以及它们的波动率。任何组合的盈亏，都可以近似写成对这些因子变动的敏感度之和。对一个线性头寸（如现货股票），盈亏与因子变动成正比；但对期权这类非线性头寸，必须用泰勒展开把敏感度逐阶拆开，这就是希腊字母的来历。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[市场风险因子] --&gt; B[利率]&#10;  A --&gt; C[汇率]&#10;  A --&gt; D[股价]&#10;  A --&gt; E[波动率]&#10;  D --&gt; F[Delta 一阶&lt;br/&gt;对标的敏感]&#10;  D --&gt; G[Gamma 二阶&lt;br/&gt;Delta 的变化]&#10;  E --&gt; H[Vega&lt;br/&gt;对波动率敏感]&#10;  B --&gt; I[Rho&lt;br/&gt;对利率敏感]&#10;  F --&gt; J[Delta 对冲]&#10;  G --&gt; K[Gamma 对冲]&#10;  H --&gt; L[Vega 对冲]&#10;  J --&gt; M[组合风险中性]&#10;  K --&gt; M&#10;  L --&gt; M\">flowchart TD\n  A[市场风险因子] --&gt; B[利率]\n  A --&gt; C[汇率]\n  A --&gt; D[股价]\n  A --&gt; E[波动率]\n  D --&gt; F[Delta 一阶&lt;br/&gt;对标的敏感]\n  D --&gt; G[Gamma 二阶&lt;br/&gt;Delta 的变化]\n  E --&gt; H[Vega&lt;br/&gt;对波动率敏感]\n  B --&gt; I[Rho&lt;br/&gt;对利率敏感]\n  F --&gt; J[Delta 对冲]\n  G --&gt; K[Gamma 对冲]\n  H --&gt; L[Vega 对冲]\n  J --&gt; M[组合风险中性]\n  K --&gt; M\n  L --&gt; M</pre><p>下表汇总主要希腊字母及其对冲含义。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>希腊字母</th>\n<th>衡量的敏感度</th>\n<th>数学含义</th>\n<th>对冲手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Delta <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>价格对标的的一阶变化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial V / \\partial S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>买卖标的现货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gamma <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Delta 对标的的变化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial^2 V / \\partial S^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用其他期权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vega <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>价格对波动率的变化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial V / \\partial \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用其他期权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theta <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Θ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>价格随时间的衰减</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial V / \\partial t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一般不对冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rho <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>价格对利率的变化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial V / \\partial r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>用利率衍生品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"希腊字母-把非线性拆成可管理的部件\">希腊字母：把非线性拆成可管理的部件</h2><p>对期权组合价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 做泰勒展开，盈亏可近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>S</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ν</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>σ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta V \\approx \\Delta \\cdot \\Delta S + \\frac{1}{2} \\Gamma \\cdot (\\Delta S)^2 + \\nu \\cdot \\Delta \\sigma + \\Theta \\cdot \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子是整个对冲实务的引擎。Delta 是一阶项，描述组合对标的小幅变动的方向暴露；把 Delta 对冲到零（Delta 中性）后，组合对标的的微小变动就不敏感了。但 Delta 本身会随标的变化，这个二阶效应由 Gamma 刻画——Gamma 越大，Delta 中性维持得越短，需要越频繁地再平衡。</p>\n<p>Vega 衡量对波动率的暴露，它解释了为什么<a href=\"../foundations/risk-measurement-statistics\">统计基础</a>里讲的隐含波动率如此重要：哪怕标的价格不动，只要市场对未来波动的预期变了，期权组合也会盈亏。Theta 是时间价值的衰减，对期权卖方是收益、对买方是成本，通常不对冲而是主动承担。这套敏感度分解的意义在于：它把一个复杂的非线性组合，翻译成几个可以分别对冲、分别设限额的标量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态对冲与对冲的代价\">动态对冲与对冲的代价</h2><p>Delta 中性不是一劳永逸的状态，而是一个需要持续维护的动态过程。标的一动，Gamma 就会改变 Delta，组合重新偏离中性，于是必须再交易标的把 Delta 拉回零——这就是动态对冲（delta hedging）。理论上连续对冲能完美复制期权，但现实里有两个无法回避的成本。</p>\n<p>第一是交易成本：每次再平衡都要付买卖价差和佣金，Gamma 越大、波动越剧烈，再平衡越频繁，成本越高。第二是离散对冲误差：你只能在离散时点调整，两次调整之间的价格跳跃无法被对冲，这部分残余风险正比于 Gamma 与价格变动平方。这解释了一个深刻的事实：对冲并不能消灭风险，只是把它从「方向风险」转化成了「Gamma 风险加交易成本」。在剧烈行情中，大量交易台同时做 Delta 对冲、同向买卖标的，还会放大市场波动，这种反馈机制在<a href=\"../regulation-stress-testing/systemic-risk\">系统性风险</a>里是顺周期性的典型来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从单台对冲到组合-var\">从单台对冲到组合 VaR</h2><p>希腊字母管的是单个台、单类因子的局部敏感度，但风险管理最终要回答整家机构「明天可能亏多少」这个总量问题，这就要回到 <a href=\"../foundations/var-expected-shortfall\">VaR/ES</a>。实务做法是把所有头寸映射到一组共同的风险因子上，构造因子收益的协方差矩阵，再据此算出组合层面的 VaR——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/var-expected-shortfall\">RiskMetrics 方差-协方差法</a>的工程实现。</p>\n<p>这里<a href=\"../foundations/risk-measurement-statistics\">相关性</a>再次成为关键：不同台的暴露可能彼此对冲（一个台多利率、另一个台空利率），组合 VaR 因此小于各台 VaR 之和——这是分散化在机构层面的体现，也是为什么风险要在集团层面集中度量而非各台自行其是。但同样要警惕，危机中相关性跳向 1，平时看似对冲的暴露会同时反向，集团 VaR 会突然暴涨。下面这张表对比单台对冲视角与组合 VaR 视角。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>关注对象</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单台对冲</td>\n<td>局部敏感度</td>\n<td>希腊字母</td>\n<td>看不到跨台分散与集中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合 VaR</td>\n<td>机构总损失</td>\n<td>因子协方差矩阵</td>\n<td>依赖相关性稳定假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压力情景</td>\n<td>极端联动</td>\n<td>假设情景</td>\n<td>见压力测试一篇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>市场风险源于有限几类风险因子，组合盈亏可近似为对这些因子敏感度之和。</li>\n<li>希腊字母把非线性暴露拆成可分别对冲的部件：Delta 管方向、Gamma 管 Delta 的变化、Vega 管波动率、Theta 管时间衰减。</li>\n<li>Delta 对冲是动态过程，对冲不消灭风险而是把方向风险转化为 Gamma 风险与交易成本；集体对冲还会放大市场波动。</li>\n<li>单台希腊字母管局部，组合 VaR 管总量，二者通过风险因子映射与协方差矩阵衔接，相关性是关键也是风险点。</li>\n<li>这套度量是 <a href=\"../regulation-stress-testing/basel-capital-regulation\">FRTB 市场风险资本规则</a>的业务基础；下一篇转向另一类主要风险——<a href=\"credit-risk\">信用风险</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"市场风险与对冲","id":"市场风险与对冲"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：风险因子与敏感度","id":"核心概念-风险因子与敏感度"},{"level":2,"text":"希腊字母：把非线性拆成可管理的部件","id":"希腊字母-把非线性拆成可管理的部件"},{"level":2,"text":"动态对冲与对冲的代价","id":"动态对冲与对冲的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"从单台对冲到组合 VaR","id":"从单台对冲到组合-var"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"VaR与预期损失","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-risk-management/foundations/var-expected-shortfall"},"next":{"title":"信用风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-risk-management/market-credit-risk/credit-risk"}}